<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 5.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, Aug 5.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 05	Aug 04   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  293.050     291.430     247.020    18.63 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.940     307.900     306.830     0.36 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  155.870     155.985     158.970    -1.95 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.194	46.256	47.182    -2.09 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  476.720     474.820     419.180    13.73 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.400     138.480     141.685    -2.32 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.929	15.962	16.185    -1.58 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  247.630     245.980     212.430    16.57 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.845	 1.851	1.8880    -2.28 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.540	 1.545	1.5810    -2.59 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.155     190.240     183.135     4.38 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
